# Naming — VTC Apps

API layout: `api-routes.mdc`. Response envelope: `api-routes.mdc`. Document fields: `data-model.mdc`.

**Spaces** in product copy; **`group_id`** in code and JWT. Data Storage UI: **Space** / **Publisher** / **Personal** — Publisher CSV token is `app` (`app-types.mdc`).

## MongoDB Collections

Pattern: `{appshortname}_{collection}`

```
✅  sketch_sketches
✅  invoicing_invoices
❌  items
```

**Exception — Space Core Records** use fixed shared names (`suite_clients`, `suite_items`, `invoicing_invoices`, …) — `core-records.mdc`. Never create your own customer, supplier, lead, product, or invoice collection (`{app}_customers`, `{app}_clients`, `{app}_contacts`, `{app}_suppliers`, `{app}_products`, `{app}_invoices`).

## API Routes

```
/api/[entity]/list     → GET
/api/[entity]/create   → POST
/api/[entity]/update   → PUT
/api/[entity]/delete   → DELETE
```

## Files & Folders

| Type | Convention | Example |
|------|-----------|---------|
| Components | PascalCase | `BackButton.tsx` |
| Pages | lowercase | `app/items/page.tsx` |
| Lib | camelCase | `clientAuth.ts` |
| Hooks | `use` prefix | `useAdminAccess.ts` |

## Variables

- Booleans: `is`, `has`, `can` — `isAdmin`, `hasAccess`
- Handlers: `handle` prefix — `handleSubmit`
- Fetchers: `fetch` prefix — `fetchItems`
- JWT fields: `user_id`, `group_id`, `role_type` (snake_case)

## Document IDs

```typescript
itemId: nanoid(10)
user_id: user.user_id
group_id: user.group_id || '0'
```

## URL Parameters (platform-injected)

| Param | Value |
|-------|-------|
| `token` | JWT |
| `user` | User ID |
| `group` | `0` = personal context (`personal-storage.mdc`); else space `group_id` |
| `mode` | `light` or `dark` |
| `lang` | `en`, `es`, `pt`, etc. |
